WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:17.045
A cat jumped down from Tom's head.

2
00:00:17.046 --> 00:00:26.424
"Oops!" said Tom in surprise.

3
00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:29.255
"You're not a fur hat.

4
00:00:29.256 --> 00:00:32.822
You're a cat!"

5
00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:36.489
"Sorry about that," Tom said to the cat.

6
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:41.350
"But I must go now.

7
00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:53.369
I need to find that map!"

8
00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:58.308
Tom went deeper and deeper into the forest.

9
00:00:58.309 --> 00:01:03.668
He looked behind branches and under roots.

10
00:01:03.669 --> 00:01:10.764
Everything looked dark and spooky.

11
00:01:10.765 --> 00:01:16.004
"Where is the map?" Tom thought.

12
00:01:16.005 --> 00:01:20.542
Snap! Snap! Crunch!

13
00:01:20.543 --> 00:01:23.854
Tom froze.

14
00:01:23.855 --> 00:01:26.411
Something was coming!

15
00:01:26.412 --> 00:01:29.466
He backed up slowly.

16
00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:32.731
Tom tripped and fell. "Oof!"

17
00:01:32.732 --> 00:01:37.696
Sticks snapped and leaves crunched.

18
00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:41.264
Tom closed his eyes.

19
00:01:41.265 --> 00:01:44.370
Suddenly—crash!

20
00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:48.999
A creature burst through the trees!

21
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.406
It was the cat!

22
00:01:51.407 --> 00:01:54.367
Tom climbed to his feet.

23
00:01:54.368 --> 00:01:57.821
"Hello," said Cat.

24
00:01:57.822 --> 00:02:00.476
Tom's jaw dropped.

25
00:02:00.477 --> 00:02:03.782
"You can talk!" Tom said.

26
00:02:03.783 --> 00:02:07.491
"Cats have nine lives," Cat said.

27
00:02:07.492 --> 00:02:13.045
"In each life we can talk to one person."

28
00:02:13.046 --> 00:02:17.387
"And you picked me," Tom said.

29
00:02:17.388 --> 00:02:22.826
He bowed. "Thank you, Cat."

30
00:02:22.827 --> 00:02:27.287
Then Tom looked around the Dark Forest.

31
00:02:27.288 --> 00:02:32.427
He sighed. "I'm lost."

32
00:02:32.428 --> 00:02:35.924
"I can lead you out of the forest," said Cat.

33
00:02:35.925 --> 00:02:39.277
Tom grinned. "You can?"

34
00:02:39.278 --> 00:02:42.717
Cat nodded. "Sure."

35
00:02:42.718 --> 00:02:47.208
"Do you know where the palace is?" Tom asked.

36
00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:50.653
"I do," Cat said.

37
00:02:50.654 --> 00:02:58.017
She climbed into Tom's pocket.

38
00:02:58.018 --> 00:03:06.681
Together the new friends started walking.
